        /** @description Current OPS account holding ops.withdrawals.review with the exact PLATFORM:platform scope. Records the review decision of one pending withdrawal. If-Match is mandatory and carries the withdrawal version, so a missing or malformed precondition is 428 and a stale version is 412; query parameters, a missing or repeated Idempotency-Key and a body that is not exactly decision plus reason are rejected. APPROVE only forms the downstream payout command and never proves settlement, so a first approval returns 202 with a Location header naming the payout, while a first rejection and any same-body replay return 200. A withdrawal that is no longer PENDING_REVIEW fails closed with 409. */
        post: operations["decideOpsWithdrawal"];
        delete?: never;
        options?: never;
        head?: never;
        patch?: never;
        trace?: never;
